 "artifact_id": "pp_c5949563fc662476994db4f8",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h1>THE EXPERIMENT RAN.<span>THE DECISION NEEDS A RECEIPT.</span></h1>",
   "id": "26127b71",
   "hash": "55f35c00a643"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Long-horizon agents generate events. Proofpress makes the useful conclusion <strong>scoped, reviewable, and safe for a fresh session to inherit.</strong></p>",
   "id": "59111a7d",
   "hash": "46a3ca9eaefe"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>What can the next agent safely inherit?</h2>",
   "id": "ad5a4616",
   "hash": "7bf7a25fb307"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Choose one experiment first. Open lineage only when you need to inspect how the decision was made.</p>",
   "id": "52ab68ed",
   "hash": "9bd4c357bc7e"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3 id=\"paperTitle\">Candidate B increased conversion.</h3>",
   "id": "03df410b",
   "hash": "b03b4c251ede"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p id=\"paperBody\">This is the result a fresh agent may want to reuse. The ledger keeps it attached to its measured run and review state.</p>",
   "id": "e165f27d",
   "hash": "349ef2d7bb83"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3 id=\"title\">Candidate B is eligible for review.</h3>",
   "id": "5d58db33",
   "hash": "2196970f1337"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p id=\"body\">Evidence is present, the experiment completed, and the metric is measured. A human or policy reviewer still decides whether this belongs in shared knowledge.</p>",
   "id": "105f3c7c",
   "hash": "ce338dcfd6c9"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>Where this decision came from.</h2>",
   "id": "185f2164",
   "hash": "01f534cce4cd"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>The main surface answers “can we continue?” This graph answers “what evidence and review state led here?”</p>",
   "id": "5a61ca84",
   "hash": "e144ad5145f9"
  },
  {
